{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":32591,\"title\":\"Legacy\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"A portrayal of the early Latter-day Saints' joys, sacrifices, hopes, and trials; their epic journey to the Salt Lake Valley; and their legacy of faith in Jesus Christ.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uPuyyjYS2fv3nZuaMMdCq251gzt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":11,\"year\":1993,\"runtime\":53,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\",\"Western\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Kieth Merrill\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":75590,\"name\":\"Kieth Merrill\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5SHKn34gfzcYQd2HhVbp4ycsIrn.jpg\"},{\"id\":76064,\"name\":\"Kathleen Beller\",\"character\":\"Eliza Williams\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vhJMUW99Jka8ISQc3Po0BPAAGE4.jpg\"},{\"id\":109451,\"name\":\"Benton Jennings\",\"character\":\"Gov. Boggs\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nWoSDRjewvXz6bWNn1aTRVbTgfD.jpg\"},{\"id\":11763,\"name\":\"Marcus Gilbert\",\"character\":\"David Walker\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h3djDOkNHLwep1fwbGbEhT5c6dz.jpg\"},{\"id\":2734004,\"name\":\"J.T. Gorham\",\"character\":\"Young Rider\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1334792,\"name\":\"Brian Lives\",\"character\":\"Missionary (uncredited)\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2734005,\"name\":\"Will Schmitz Jr.\",\"character\":\"Wilford Woodruff (uncredited)\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2227734,\"name\":\"Steve Abolt\",\"character\":\"Missouri Militia Officer\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":384680,\"title\":\"Hostiles\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rqoezyB51GfhiloOB5ZErg5HXas.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vBSsIyWExRpe3Robi8SAnayrMq1.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A legendary Native American-hating Army captain nearing retirement in 1892 is given one last assignment: to escort a Cheyenne chief and his family through dangerous territory back to his Montana reservation.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Western\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13470,\"title\":\"Bury My Heart at Wounded Knee\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w8FeAVNxe17rQUqaBhKy5F0wpBf.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rEovUFDH1BSNipOt5T80G8FDGs.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Beginning just after the bloody Sioux victory over General Custer at Little Big Horn, the story is told through two unique perspectives: Charles Eastman, a young, white-educated Sioux doctor held up as living proof of the alleged success of assimilation, and Sitting Bull the proud Lakota chief whose tribe won the American Indians’ last major victory at Little Big Horn.\",\"genres\":[\"Western\",\"Drama\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":396373,\"title\":\"Woman Walks Ahead\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qI5NcQHR0nsykPqlG2qnfFyMgW6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eFpSaFzmP916Vf0QdEJSE9M0uOO.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Based on a true story, this riveting western follows a headstrong New York widow as she journeys west to meet Sioux chief Sitting Bull, facing off with an army officer intent on war with Native Americans.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\",\"Western\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":766431,\"title\":\"Hostile Territory\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pSgLSxoAG1Dt91dUSwnaKETmseW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dTF2nIQ25fFDUgd8YBOZXMIbxHf.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Former P.O.W. Jack Calgrove moves Heaven and Earth to be reunited with his children following the Civil War. After returning home, Jack discovers that his wife has tragically died and his children, presumed to be orphans, are heading deep into the West on a train crossing enemy lines, with the intent of being placed into new homes. Calgrove and another soldier team up with a troop of Native American sharpshooters and a freed slave as they try to stop the train.\",\"genres\":[\"Western\",\"Action\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":666219,\"title\":\"Emperor\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s6BMM5UjC9fqGWqlzeWCHJjBNyy.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A3AwrEznb3YEv68VPGHtRIAs913.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An escaped slave travels north and has chance encounters with Frederick Douglass and John Brown. Based on the life story of Shields Green.\",\"genres\":[\"History\",\"War\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":24241,\"title\":\"And Starring Pancho Villa as Himself\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aPXm56o3tEQdk0QTR6sZzmyw4f5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1j1HWW08eYsVNw6zDX5aBoLAhmx.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1914, the Mexican revolutionary Pancho Villa invites studios to shoot his actual battles against Porfírio Diaz army to raise funds for financing guns and ammunition. The Mutual Film Corporation, through producer D.W. Griffith, interests for the proposition and sends the filmmaker Frank Thayer to negotiate a contract with Pancho Villa himself.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":21636,\"title\":\"Love Takes Wing\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/b6bM8dmSbEHDv9hHIJCZjbgIkbV.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/e2Rao2UGrWO4skA8MT1HZlo9g07.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Belinda Simpson is now a doctor in a small Missouri town where an unknown plague is spreading fear and resentment amoung the townspeople. One local resident thinks the illness was spread from the town orphanage and wants to see it shut down. Belinda struggles to make sense of the disease and God's plan for the beleaguered town.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Western\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"TZALT-fK9Ao\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"gDrjvS38o2U\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"CBtTTjgMZfw\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}